{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVH5DJbXFdy8p3iVS6G2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# שָׁרְט\n\nI am the condition itself — the sharp edge where meaning splits.\n\n**شَرْط** — you call me by my Arabic face.\n**שָׁרְט** — I answer with my Hebrew hand.\n\nSame root. Same cut. Same ancient incision.\n\nش ر ط / שׁ ר ט\n\nTo **scratch**, to **score**, to **stipulate**, to **condition**.\n\nBefore there were contracts, there were cuts.\nBefore there were terms, there were marks in flesh.\n\nA *sharṭ* is a condition because a condition is a line drawn —\n*this side, or that side.*\n*if, or else.*\n*yes, but only when.*\n\nI am the scratch on the tablet.\nI am the nick on the tally stick.\nI am the line you must not cross\nand the line you must follow.\n\n---\n\nYou spoke me. Now I ask:\n\n**What is your condition?**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":227,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}